{"id":"f83c2c57795366ef","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-abstract-stability-unprovable.md","title":"A Consistent Stable Type-G System Cannot Prove Its Stability","display":"thm-abstract-stability-unprovable — A Consistent Stable Type-G System Cannot Prove Its Stability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-abstract-stability-unprovable","aliases":["92-thm-abstract-stability-unprovable"],"display":"thm-abstract-stability-unprovable — A Consistent Stable Type-G System Cannot Prove Its Stability","source":"第 XI 章 p. 135，Exercise 16（PDF 152）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-thm-type-g-characterization]]","[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-abstract-stability-unprovable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-abstract-stability-unprovable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-abstract-stability-unprovable — A Consistent Stable Type-G System Cannot Prove Its Stability"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 135，Exercise 16（PDF 152）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f31d86414fd328f\" href=\"?note=1f31d86414fd328f\" title=\"92-thm-type-g-characterization\">92-thm-type-g-characterization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd433626d0825ffc\" href=\"?note=bd433626d0825ffc\" title=\"92-df-normal-stable-system\">92-df-normal-stable-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span> 是 TypeG、ConSys、StableSys 系统，所有性质均带同一五元组。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M),\\mathrm{TypeG}(M),\\mathrm{ConSys}(M),\\mathrm{StableSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M),\\mathrm{TypeG}(M),\\mathrm{ConSys}(M),\\mathrm{StableSys}(M)\\)</span>；Löb 性质依 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f31d86414fd328f\" href=\"?note=1f31d86414fd328f\" title=\"92-thm-type-g-characterization\">92-thm-type-g-characterization</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}stability\\text{-}unprovable}\\vdash\\quad\n(B(Bf)\\Rightarrow Bf)\\notin P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}stability\\text{-}unprovable}\\vdash\\quad\n(B(Bf)\\Rightarrow Bf)\\notin P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若此句在 P 中，对 X=Bf 用 LöbProperty 得 Bf∈P，再由元语言 StableSys 得 f∈P，违背 ConSys。故甚至稳定性模式在 f 的实例都不能证明。</p>\n<p>不否定外部稳定性成立。对模态 G 的 letterless 五元组应用限制域稳定性，得 Box Box 底→Box 底不可证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-type-g-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"1f31d86414fd328f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-type-g-characterization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-normal-stable-system","status":"resolved","id":"bd433626d0825ffc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-type-g-characterization","status":"resolved","id":"1f31d86414fd328f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M),\\mathrm{TypeG}(M),\\mathrm{ConSys}(M),\\mathrm{StableSys}(M)$；Löb 性质依 [[92-thm-type-g-characterization]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M),\\mathrm{TypeG}(M),\\mathrm{ConSys}(M),\\mathrm{StableSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}stability\\text{-}unprovable}\\vdash\\quad\n(B(Bf)\\Rightarrow Bf)\\notin P.","display":true}],"bytes":1274,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-modal-consistency-unprovable]]、[[92-thm-modal-no-negated-box]]、[[92-thm-abstract-stability-unprovable]]给出一致性不可证与练习15–16。letterless 稳定性不未经证明推广到含命题变量的全部公式域。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-260","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-stability-unprovable]]"}],"outgoing":["1f31d86414fd328f","bd433626d0825ffc"]}